          "html": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Hello,</p><p>Thank you for applying for the AI Automation Specialist position at TechVision Solutions.</p><p>We are pleased to inform you that your application has been shortlisted. We would like to invite you for an online interview on November 12, 2026, at 10:00 AM.</p><p>Please confirm your availability by replying to this email.</p><p>Best regards,</p><p>HR Recruitment Team<br>TechVision Solutions</p></div>\n",
